{"id":"conductor","lemma":"conductor","pos":"noun","rank":1579,"glosses":["driver","motorist","presenter; host (of a television show)"],"ipa":"/konduɡˈtoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"conductores","feminine":"conductora","femininePlural":"conductoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-conductor.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él es mal conductor.","en":"He is a bad driver.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450493"},{"text":"Muchos conductores abandonaron sus coches en la nieve.","en":"Many drivers abandoned their cars in the snow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705363"},{"text":"Ella es una pésima conductora.","en":"She is a very poor driver."},{"text":"Es conductor de autobús.","en":"He is a bus driver.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450143"},{"text":"Los conductores de autobús van a hacer huelga hoy.","en":"The bus drivers are going on strike today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692209"}]}